  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The <b>three Goddesses of Fate</b> got into a fight and one of them left
    on the spot! Until the remaining two find her, they are having a hard time deciding
    whether this or that mortal must <b>live or die</b>. So, they take advantage
    of being in an otherworldly bar to settle the issue via <b>pool games</b>. \n\r\n<b>Connor</b>,
    a young Irishman who got badly hurt in a brawl, is tonight\u2019s poor soul for
    the Goddesses to choose the fate. Every aspect of his life has been turned into
    a ball: <b>whenever two of them collide</b> on the green table, a <b>prophecy</b>
    about Connor\u2019s future involving their two respective aspects is written.
    \n\r\nIf you, the Goddess of Birth, win, Connor\u2019s life will be <b>spared</b>;
    otherwise, the Goddess of Death will <b>pocket his soul\u2026</b>\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f03c85def5e7e9e48824ce975078b9aa, type: 2}
