  m_text: "Control the cue <b>rotation</b> with the mouse and the <b>force</b> with
    the scroll wheel. \nEach turn, try to pocket a ball with a <color=green>green
    </color> halo. If you manage so, you play again. \nCollisions on the <color=#008000ff>right
    side </color>of the table will trigger positive prophecies; those on the <color=#008080ff>left
    side </color>will trigger negative ones. \nOnce you've pocketed all your balls,
    pocket the <color=grey><b>black one</b></color> - that's a win ! You saved Connor
    !"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f03c85def5e7e9e48824ce975078b9aa, type: 2}
